            <div xml:id="d536">

                <pb facs="0731" n="641" xml:id="pg641"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">300.115/20734: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-04T18:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 4, 1920—6
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 4—2:15 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>In Prize Court yesterday President dealt with claims arising from reprisals order
                    of March 11th, 1915, ordering those who appeared as claimants to select three
                    cases and plead within a period of 14 days, 7 days later Crown’s answer to be
                    delivered, trial to follow speedily to wind up outstanding business.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
